Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:58:41 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] crt-emu: EN/RU language buttons in the panel, default
 from the game

The F12 panel gets EN and RU buttons at the right end of the Save row.
A press switches the panel at once: the shader's //@lang block of the
new language and the panel's own strings; live and saved values stay as
they are and the shader file is not touched. The choice is written as
lang= to install.ini next to the shader (other lines kept byte for byte,
the line appended or the file created if missing); a press on the lit
button writes it too. Group headers keep their open state across a
switch. Should the shader lose its parameters meanwhile, the panel
closes instead of holding the game's input.

Without lang= the panel follows the game's language, <Language> =
"#ru.ini" in the HD mod profile _HD3_Data\Settings\hota.ini two folders
above the shader, then the Windows display language, then English.

Shader files and install.ini are written through one helper (.tmp, then
MoveFileEx). CRTEMU_OSD_TEST builds can press the buttons.

